---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: How the screenshots renew themselves
    accDescr: After a change of main that touches a file of .github/screenshots-paths.txt, after every release and every week, the plan of the screenshot bot starts a run by hand, as the branch bot and a person do; without scripts/screenshots.sh, the bot renders nothing. The runs by hand render one at a time, the newest main. Each shard that .github/screenshots.toml names renders its pictures of that commit side by side, without secrets, and each picture whose pixels stayed the same keeps its committed file. When pixels changed, the job collect puts the shards together, and when main changed none of these files while they rendered, one pull request from bot/screenshots holds the new pictures, the files that the settings name and the width and height that the pages name for the pictures, and merges itself once every check passes; when main looks as rendered, the bot closes it. When main changed one of them meanwhile, as when the pull request before merged, or when the pull request conflicts with main later, the bot renders main anew: by itself, or started by the branch bot. So every picture shows the project as it is.

    event["`A change of main that touches<br>a file of the list, a release,<br>every week or by hand`"]
    script{"Has the repository<br>scripts/screenshots.sh?"}
    off["No script:<br>the bot renders nothing"]
    queue["`A run by hand renders<br>the newest *main*,<br>one run at a time`"]
    render["`Each shard renders its<br>pictures of that commit,<br>side by side, without secrets`"]
    pixels{"Did pixels change,<br>compared with main?"}
    same["`Same pixels: the picture<br>keeps its committed file,<br>an open pull request closes`"]
    collect["`The job *collect* puts<br>the shards together`"]
    moved{"Did main change one of<br>these files while they rendered?"}
    pr["`One pull request from<br>*bot/screenshots* with the<br>new sizes on the pages,<br>that merges itself`"]
    again["`The bot renders main anew:<br>by itself, or started by<br>the branch bot after a conflict`"]
    done["Every picture shows<br>the project as it is"]

    event --> script
    script -- "no" --> off
    script -- "yes" --> queue --> render --> pixels
    pixels -- "no" --> same --> done
    pixels -- "yes" --> collect --> moved
    moved -- "no" --> pr --> done
    moved -- "yes" --> again
    pr -- "conflicts with main later" --> again
    again --> queue

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class queue,render,collect,pr,again bot
    class off person
    class done done
